(5, 'meta_description', 'The Diocese of Soroti is led by the Bishop Kosea Odongo who is the 6th Bishop of the Diocese and was consecrated on 16th June 2019.', '2022-12-07 17:23:47', '2022-12-07 17:23:47'),
